    "lawCode": "Amd §1676 & 1680, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3339\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto amend the public authorities law, in relation to providing financing\nand construction of capital facilities for Williamsburg Infant and\nEarly Childhood Development Center\n\nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\nTo provide financing and construction of capital facilities for\nWilliamsburg Infant and Early Childhood Development Center.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\nParagraph (b) of subdivision 2 of section 1676 and subdivision 1 of\nsection 1680 of the Public Authorities Law are amended.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nWilliamsburg Infant and Early Childhood Development Center opened in\n1985, serving children with disabilities starting with only 4 students;\nthey now serve 80 and have a waiting list over 20 students long. This\nbill will allow the Williamsburg Infant and Early Childhood\nDevelopment Center to borrow construction capital from DASNY at a\nreduced interest rate so as to allow the center to increase in size\nto accommodate a 180 student enrollment.\n\nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nUndetermined.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n\n",
